{"speciesId":686,"names":{"fr":"Sepiatop","es":"Inkay","en":"Inkay","ja":"マーイーカ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Éblouis par les points lumineux qui clignotent sur son corps, les ennemis perdent toute envie de se battre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los enemigos que contemplan el titilante fulgor de su brillante cuerpo terminan mareándose y pierden las ganas de continuar combatiendo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"発光体の 点滅を 見つめた 相手は 目が くらみ 戦う 気持ちが なくなってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il ébranle le moral des ennemis lui cherchant noise grâce aux clignotements qu’il émet. Il profite de cette diversion pour se cacher."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La luz intermitente que emite aplaca el ánimo de lucha del enemigo. Aprovecha la ocasión para esconderse."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent’s will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"光の 点滅で 襲ってきた 敵の 戦意を なくしてしまう。 その すきに 姿を くらますのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Éblouis par les points lumineux qui clignotent sur son corps, les ennemis perdent toute envie de se battre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los enemigos que contemplan el titilante fulgor de su brillante cuerpo terminan mareándose y pierden las ganas de continuar combatiendo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"発光体の 点滅を 見つめた 相手は 目が くらみ 戦う 気持ちが なくなってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il ébranle le moral des ennemis lui cherchant noise grâce aux clignotements qu’il émet. Il profite de cette diversion pour se cacher."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La luz intermitente que emite aplaca el ánimo de lucha del enemigo. Aprovecha la ocasión para esconderse."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent’s will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"光の 点滅で 襲ってきた 敵の 戦意を なくしてしまう。 その すきに 姿を くらますのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il attire ses proies en faisant clignoter son corps, puis les immobilise en les enserrant de ses longs tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Los destellos que emite atraen a su presa, a la que rodea con sus largos tentáculos e inmoviliza por completo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It draws prey near with its blinking lights and then wraps them up in its long tentacles and holds them in place."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"光を 点滅させて 獲物を おびきよせると 長い 触手で 絡めとり 動きを 封じるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il fait clignoter ses points lumineux à différentes fréquences pour échanger des informations avec ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los complejos patrones de destellos que emite con sus órganos luminosos le permiten comunicarse con sus congéneres."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When exchanging information with others of its kind, it flashes the light-emitting spots on its body in a complex rhythm."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"仲間と 情報 交換を するとき 身体の 発光体を 複雑な リズムで 光らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il fait clignoter son corps lumineux en tournoyant. Il communique avec ses congénères à l’aide de signaux de lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Gira sobre sí mismo emitiendo luz intermitente con la que crea señales para comunicarse con los suyos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It spins while making its luminescent spots flash. These spots allow it to communicate with others by using different patterns of light."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"回転しながら 発光体を 点滅。 光の パターンで 仲間と コミュニケーションする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il sape la combativité de son adversaire en faisant clignoter son corps lumineux, puis profite de cet instant de répit pour s’enfuir."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Los destellos de luz intermitente que emite aplacan el ánimo de lucha del enemigo, tras lo que aprovecha para esconderse."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"By exposing foes to the blinking of its luminescent spots, Inkay demoralizes them, and then it seizes the chance to flee."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"敵に 発光体の 点滅を 浴びせて 戦意を なくしてしまう。 その 隙に 逃げ出すのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":686,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",21],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"m